{"title": "Arcane Critical (Condition)", "pageid": 30859, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Arcane_Critical_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has stack type", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f9/Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f9/Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f9/Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Generic Threat Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f9/Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f9/Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Arcane Critical</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>The number you need to <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">roll</a> a <a href=\"/wiki/Critical_Hit\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Critical Hit\">Critical Hit</a> while attacking is reduced by 2. This effect can stack. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_CRITICAL_ARCANIC_CRITICAL</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CMAG_CRITICAL_ARCANIC_CRITICAL%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CMAG_CRITICAL_ARCANIC_CRITICAL%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Stack_type\" title=\"Conditions\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png/25px-Sort_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png/38px-Sort_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"If already applied\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png/25px-Sort_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Stack_type\" title=\"Conditions\">If already applied</a>: replace current</div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>While the tooltip says Arcane Critical improves your critical hit threshold by 2, it actually only improves it by 1.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Arcane_Critical\">Sources of Arcane Critical</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Critical\" title=\"Arcane Critical\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Seeking_Spell_Icon.webp/30px-Seeking_Spell_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Seeking_Spell_Icon.webp/45px-Seeking_Spell_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Seeking_Spell_Icon.webp/60px-Seeking_Spell_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Arcane Critical\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Seeking_Spell_Icon.webp/30px-Seeking_Spell_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Seeking_Spell_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Critical\" title=\"Arcane Critical\">Arcane Critical</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715154935\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.044 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.048 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1274/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 17009/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4661/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.020/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 976655/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   41.552      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   41.552      1 -total\n 59.76%   24.832      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 31.99%   13.292      2 Template:Condition_sources\n 15.37%    6.385      3 Template:Template_style\n 15.15%    6.297      3 Template:Icon_link\n 14.16%    5.885      3 Template:Icon_text\n 13.98%    5.808      1 Template:Condition_sources/format\n 13.31%    5.532     15 Template:Trim\n 12.53%    5.2